#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Misc
#------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Merge tool leftovers
*.orig
*.rej
*.BACKUP.*
*.BASE.*
*.LOCAL.*
*.REMOTE.*

# Backup / swap files
*.swp
*.swo
*.old

# Generated code you don't want tracked (uncomment as needed)
# **/Generated/
# *.g.cs
# *.generated.cs

# Keep launch settings for the shared team profile (commented = tracked).
# Uncomment if each developer should keep their own:
# **/Properties/launchSettings.json